[node name="Content" type="RichTextLabel" parent="PanelContainer/VBox/ScrollContainer"]
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_horizontal = 3
bbcode_enabled = true
fit_content = true
text = "[b]GOAL[/b]
Reach [b]500 score[/b] first to win the round. A new round begins after a 5-second countdown.

[b]CONTROLS[/b]
WASD             — Move
Shift            — Sprint
1–9 / Scroll     — Select hotbar item
LMB              — Attack / Use
E                — Interact / Place item
Q                — Drop selected item
C                — Crafting menu
Enter            — Chat
ESC              — Settings

[b]EARNING SCORE[/b]
Destroy world objects (trees, rocks)  +1
Kill a mob (zombie, spider, etc.)     +2
Kill a player                         +4
Windmill (passive, per 10 sec each)  +10

[b]GATHERING & CRAFTING[/b]
Harvest trees for [b]wood[/b], rocks for [b]stone[/b].
Press [b]C[/b] to open the crafting menu. Select a recipe on the left, then craft if you have the ingredients.
Place craftable items with [b]E[/b] facing the target location.

[b]STRUCTURES[/b]
Walls and doors block enemy and player movement.
[b]Windmills[/b] generate +10 score every 10 seconds for the player who placed them — defend them!
Chests store items. Torches repel nearby enemies.

[b]SERVER COMMANDS[/b]  (host only, type in chat)
/give points [name] [amount]         — grant score to a player
/give item [name] [item_id] [amount] — give an item to a player
/spawn [mob_id] [name]               — spawn a mob near a player"

[connection signal="pressed" from="PanelContainer/VBox/HeaderRow/CloseButton" to="." method="_on_close_pressed"]
